		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New Beta 2023 11 11]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3495&amp;p=27536#p27536"><![CDATA[
A new version of the CPS is available<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest/</a><br><br>This includes the following changes<br><ul><li> Fix bug with CSV import/export.</li><li> Fix rounding error on some CTCSS tones</li> <li> Various languages updates/fixes.</li><li> Add Turkish</li><li> Fix location coordinates problems.</li><li> APRS configurations added.</li><li> GPS NMEA log extraction (on featured devices).</li><li> Adds "Backup registers" for STM32 devices.</li><li> Supports DM-1701 with RGB LCD panels.</li><li> Support calibration read/write (but no edition) for STM32 radios.</li><li> Hide unused columns in the contacts form.</li><li> Reduces a bit the DMRIDs storage space for the 16Mb devices, for NMEA logging (still able to store more than the whole database).</li><li> Various bugfixes.</li></ul>Thanks to Daniel F1RMB  and Colin G4EML for their work on these changes.<br><br><span style="font-size:150%;line-height:116%">As usual the password is the version number, including the R</span><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Nov 19, 2023 9:44 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
